  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Duke Long’s qi path system lists it with Qi Breath Mountain, Hidden Dragon Qi Explosion, Qi Engulfing Mountains and Rivers, and Qi Current Scissors. These offensive methods have more obvious long range power than his transformation path offense.",
      "chapters": [
        1945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "move_qi_breath_mountain",
        "move_hidden_dragon_qi_explosion",
        "move_qi_engulfing_mountains_and_rivers",
        "move_qi_current_scissors"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal killer move great qi hand explosion is named. Duke Long stretches his left arm and spreads his five fingers, his palm toward a rank seven Immortal Gu House, then clenches that hand. Great qi explodes, the house splits into fragments, Immortal Gu are destroyed, and none of the Gu Immortals inside survive.",
      "chapters": [
        1951
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-seven-immortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Sea Ancestor raises his right fist, spreads his fingers, and aims his palm at Spectral Soul, then at the black smoke spiral shielding him. Immortal killer move great qi hand explosion is named. The spiral tears apart, and Dragon Palace, already damaged, draws a golden trail and escapes.",
      "chapters": [
        2043
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escape-enabled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor",
        "house_dragon_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal killer move great qi hand explosion is named. Qi Sea Ancestor activates it, Spectral Soul moves a hundred arms and black smoke appears around him, and the killer move is about to break. Demon Immortal Qi Jue hits Spectral Soul with Upper-Lower Breathless Qi, and the defensive method that resisted great qi hand explosion becomes much weaker. Great qi hand explosion succeeds, Demon Immortal Qi Jue uses a supplementary method to double its strength, Giant Spectral Soul is sent flying, and tens of black arms explode.",
      "chapters": [
        2054
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
